{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774029009,"nonce":"MvAhIUCMLoxoloMUuEVVTtOwq1o=","title":"P4: Work-unit API + inbox routes rewrite","message":"Parent: f3dbb3e\nDepends on: a247bc3 (P1 — work-unit schema must exist)\n\nWork-unit CRUD API and rewritten inbox routes using work-unit model.\n\n## Work-unit API routes (src/routes/work-units.ts — new file)\n- POST /api/work-units/claim — create work unit (state=open, branch, issue_id, repo_id). Called by wt --issue.\n- POST /api/work-units/activate — update state to committed, set activated_at/last_commit_at. Called by agent-commit.\n- POST /api/work-units/release — set state to open, clear branch/assignment. Called by dwt.\n- PATCH /api/work-units/:id — update fields (continuation, assigned_session_id, state)\n- GET /api/work-units — list with filters (state, repo_id, branch, has_live_agent)\n- GET /api/work-units/:id — single work unit with liveness overlay\n\n## Liveness overlay\n- When serving work units, join to sessions table by branch\n- Compute liveness per session (checkLiveness from registry)\n- Return has_live_agent, agent_actively_working (SDK processing), last_activity\n\n## Inbox rewrite (src/routes/inbox.ts)\n- Replace \"open issues\" section with work-unit query: work units in open state with no live agent\n- Keep auth_results section (unchanged)\n- Replace \"continuations\" section with work units that have continuation text and no live agent\n- Each inbox item links to its issue (not standalone)\n\n## Reconciler (periodic)\n- On ReaperTimer tick: scan work units in committed state, check if auth request completed for their branch → auto-resolve\n- Scan work units with assigned_session_id where session is dead → clear assignment, flag as needs attention\n- Check for branches that were deleted → mark work unit as abandoned\n\n## Integration hooks\n- Hook into storeExecutionResult in auth-queue.ts: on exitCode===0, resolve linked work units\n- Hook into agent-commit POST handler: upsert work unit activation","files":null}]}